---
// One rulebook: the same rules are enforced by two checkers and taught by six skills.
---

<figure class="chisel-diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 680 290" role="img" aria-label="One rulebook of about 55 rules fans out to the chisel checker for Python and FastAPI, the chisel-js checker for TypeScript and SvelteKit, and the six agent skills.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="spec-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-3)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect x="240" y="20" width="200" height="60" rx="10" fill="var(--sl-color-accent-low)" stroke="var(--sl-color-accent)" />
    <text x="340" y="45" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" fill="var(--sl-color-white)">~55 rules</text>
    <text x="340" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-2)">one rulebook</text>

    <line x1="290" y1="86" x2="135" y2="180" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-3)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#spec-arrow)" />
    <line x1="340" y1="86" x2="340" y2="180" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-3)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#spec-arrow)" />
    <line x1="390" y1="86" x2="545" y2="180" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-3)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#spec-arrow)" />

    <rect x="30" y="190" width="190" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-6)" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-4)" />
    <text x="125" y="220" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-family="var(--sl-font-system-mono, monospace)" fill="var(--sl-color-white)">chisel</text>
    <text x="125" y="243" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-2)">Python · FastAPI</text>

    <rect x="245" y="190" width="190" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-6)" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-4)" />
    <text x="340" y="220" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-family="var(--sl-font-system-mono, monospace)" fill="var(--sl-color-white)">chisel-js</text>
    <text x="340" y="243" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-2)">TypeScript · SvelteKit</text>

    <rect x="460" y="190" width="190" height="70" rx="10" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-6)" stroke="var(--sl-color-gray-4)" />
    <text x="555" y="220" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-family="var(--sl-font-system-mono, monospace)" fill="var(--sl-color-white)">skills/</text>
    <text x="555" y="243" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-2)">six agent skills</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Two checkers enforce the rulebook, six skills teach it. Backend and frontend follow the same architectural intent.</figcaption>
</figure>
